    "text": "Deglaze with ½ cup wine and let it cook away, then add the remaining cup of wine and the broth. Bring it to a simmer and pour it into a 4–6 qt slow cooker. Stir in the carrots, potatoes and 6 thyme sprigs, lay the chicken on top meat-side up, cover, and cook on low 4–5 hours."
